  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Iconic AF1 Low silhouette with elevated materials and a slightly thicker midsole\nWoven textile upper with supple suede overlays for breathable comfort and texture\nSignature Swoosh overlays on the sidewalls and a perforated toe box equip heritage design\nClassic lacing system and a hardware lace dubrae secure the fit\nLow-cut collar enhances a comfortable ankle fit and feel\nPadded, low-cut collar provides a clean look and a comfortable fit around the ankle\nEncapsulated Nike Air unit in the heel delivers lightweight, resilient cushioning\nNon-marking rubber outsole with the signature pivot-circle pattern for durable grip\nThe Nike Air Force 1 '07 LV8 Woven is imported\nUpgrade your look to legendary status with the Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 LV8 Woven Casual Shoes. Since its debut as the first basketball shoe to feature Nike Air, the AF1 has transcended its hoops origins to become one of the most influential designs in history. This edition stays true to the silhouette and design cues that made it a sneakerhead staple, but with a woven upper for lightweight breathability that comes through in the clutch during the warmer months.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 LV8 Woven Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 1